[
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "# Barriers → Supabase (Rota Livre)\n\nThe web app publishes barrier reports and \"Já não está\" answers over MQTT (contract in the root `CLAUDE.md`).\nThis notebook stores them in Supabase Postgres (`hackathon/db/schema.sql`):\n\n- `RouteBarrierMessage` sorts what arrives on `access/barriers/<id>`: a report goes to\n  `access/db/barriers/upsert`, an empty message (the reporter deleted it) to `access/db/barriers/deleted`.\n  Ids that do not look like the app's (`b` + letters/digits) are ignored.\n- `BarriersDB` (PostgreSQL connector) writes them, plus every answer on `access/barriers/+/feedback`.\n  Inserts are idempotent (`ON CONFLICT`), so a retained message delivered twice does no harm.\n\nNeeds, on the broker (setup in `hackathon/db/README.md`): env `SUPABASE_DB_HOST`, env `SUPABASE_DB_USER`,\nsecret `SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD`."
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "lot",
    "value": "DEFINE ACTION RouteBarrierMessage\nON TOPIC \"access/barriers/+\" DO\n    SET \"barrierId\" WITH TOPIC POSITION 3\n    SET \"body\" WITH PAYLOAD TRIM\n    IF {barrierId} MATCHES REGEX \"^b[0-9a-z]{4,40}$\" THEN\n        IF {body} == \"\" THEN\n            PUBLISH TOPIC \"access/db/barriers/deleted\" WITH {barrierId}\n        ELSE\n            PUBLISH TOPIC \"access/db/barriers/upsert\" WITH PAYLOAD"
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "lot",
    "value": "DEFINE ROUTE BarriersDB WITH TYPE POSTGRESQL\n    ADD SQL_CONFIG\n        WITH SERVER GET ENV \"SUPABASE_DB_HOST\"\n        WITH PORT 5432\n        WITH DATABASE \"postgres\"\n        WITH USERNAME GET ENV \"SUPABASE_DB_USER\"\n        WITH PASSWORD GET SECRET \"SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD\"\n        WITH USE_SSL true\n    ADD EVENT UpsertBarrier\n        WITH SOURCE_TOPIC \"access/db/barriers/upsert\"\n        WITH QUERY \"INSERT INTO public.barriers (id, kind, description, lat, lon, reported_at, expires_at) VALUES ('{payload.json.id}', '{payload.json.kind}', '{payload.json.description}', CAST('{payload.json.lat}' AS DOUBLE PRECISION), CAST('{payload.json.lon}' AS DOUBLE PRECISION), CAST('{payload.json.reported_at}' AS TIMESTAMPTZ), CAST('{payload.json.expires_at}' AS TIMESTAMPTZ)) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET kind = EXCLUDED.kind, description = EXCLUDED.description, lat = EXCLUDED.lat, lon = EXCLUDED.lon, reported_at = EXCLUDED.reported_at, expires_at = EXCLUDED.expires_at, deleted_at = NULL\"\n    ADD EVENT MarkBarrierDeleted\n        WITH SOURCE_TOPIC \"access/db/barriers/deleted\"\n        WITH QUERY \"UPDATE public.barriers SET deleted_at = NOW() WHERE id = '{payload}' AND deleted_at IS NULL\"\n    ADD EVENT StoreGoneAnswer\n        WITH SOURCE_TOPIC \"access/barriers/+/feedback\"\n        WITH QUERY \"INSERT INTO public.barrier_feedback (id, barrier_id, answer, answered_at, lat, lon) VALUES ('{payload.json.id}', '{payload.json.barrier_id}', '{payload.json.answer}', CAST('{payload.json.answered_at}' AS TIMESTAMPTZ), CAST(NULLIF(NULLIF('{payload.json.lat}', ''), 'null') AS DOUBLE PRECISION), CAST(NULLIF(NULLIF('{payload.json.lon}', ''), 'null') AS DOUBLE PRECISION)) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING\""
  }
]
